@host = http://localhost:5205

### Listar todos los autos
GET {{host}}/api/autos
Accept: application/json

###

### Buscar un auto por ID
GET {{host}}/api/autos/2
Accept: application/json

###

### Registrar un auto valido
POST {{host}}/api/autos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "Mercedes Benz",
  "modelo": "E 320",
  "precio": 60.00,
  "year": 2015
}

###

### Registrar un auto antiguo (debe fallar)
POST {{host}}/api/autos
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "marca": "BMW",
  "modelo": "M3",
  "precio": 60.00,
  "year": 2022
}

###

### Actualizar un auto existente
PUT {{host}}/api/autos/2
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "id": 2,
  "marca": "Mercedes Benz",
  "modelo": "E 320",
  "precio": 50.00,
  "year": 2021
}

###

### Eliminar un auto
DELETE {{host}}/api/autos/1

###

### Registrar alquiler (pendiente de implementar)
POST {{host}}/api/alquileres
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": 1,
  "autoId": 1,
  "fechaInicio": "2026-12-10T10:00:00",
  "fechaFin": "2026-12-14T10:00:00"
}